@page
@model IndexModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Home";
}

<section class="section-background text-center">
    <h1 class="display-4">Welcome!</h1>
    <article class="hero">
        <img class="hero-image" src="images/hero.jpg" alt="Engagement" />
    </article>
    
    <article class="text-section">
        <h2>You are invited to the wedding of Jane & Joe</h2>

        <div class="image-banner">
            <img class="banner-picture" src="~/images/img-banner1.png" alt="" />
            <img class="banner-picture" src="~/images/img-banner2.png" alt="" />
            <img class="banner-picture" src="~/images/img-banner3.png" alt="" />
            <img class="banner-picture" src="~/images/img-banner4.png" alt="" />
            <img class="banner-picture" src="~/images/img-banner5.png" alt="" />
        </div>

        <p>
            We’re so happy to have you here! 
            Welcome to the official wedding website of Jane & Joe. 
            Here you’ll find everything you need to know about our special day, 
            from the ceremony and reception to travel information, accommodation, dress code, 
            and more.
        </p>
        <p class="text-under-title"><i>We can’t wait to celebrate with you!</i></p>
    </article>

    <article class="text-section">
        <h2>Jane & Joe's wedding</h2>
        <p class="text-under-title">@Model.Ceremony.StartTime.ToString("MMMM d, yyyy") - @Model.Ceremony.StartTime.ToString("h:mm tt")</p>
        <p>
            <strong>@Model.Ceremony.Location - @Model.Ceremony.Address</strong><br />
            Join us as we celebrate the beginning of Jane and Joe's next chapter together.<br />

            An afternoon ceremony will be followed by dinner, drinks, dancing, and an evening of 
            celebration with family and friends.<br />

            <strong><a asp-page="/Event" class="link-in-text">Read more about the event here</a></strong><br />
        </p>
        <p class="text-under-title"><i>We hope to see you there!</i></p>
    </article>

    <article class="text-section">
        <h2>Our story</h2>

        <p>
            Jane and Joe met at a coffee shop and quickly discovered their shared love of books, 
            music, and travel. Since then, they have built a life together filled with adventures, 
            laughter, and memorable moments.

            Joe proposed during a weekend trip to the coast, and Jane said yes. 
            
            Now, they are incredibly excited to take the next step in their journey and celebrate 
            their wedding surrounded by the people who mean the most to them.

            Thank you for being part of their story. They can't wait to celebrate this unforgettable 
            day with you!
        </p>
    </article>
</section>
